[01:13.86] Whisper your name
[01:17.35] In an empty room
[01:22.10] You brush past my skin
[01:25.27] As soft as fur
[01:30.28] Taking hold
[01:33.22] I taste your scent
[01:38.78] Distant noises
[01:42.95] Other voices
[01:47.32] Pounding in my broken head
[01:55.33] Commit the sin, commit yourself
[02:03.32] And all the other voices said
[02:12.07] Change your mind you're always wrong
[02:27.60] (Always wrong)
[02:36.90] Come around at Christmas
[02:39.79] I really have to see you
[02:44.43] Smile at me slyly
[02:48.03] Another festive compromise
[02:52.59] But I live with desertion
[02:55.95] And eight million people
[03:01.05] Distant noises
[03:05.21] Of other voices
